  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity will survive its near-term crises but will be irrevocably transformed by its own technology. We will expand into the solar system, but in doing so, will fragment into a diverse family of post-human and synthetic intelligences. By the year 10000, the original 'Homo sapiens' will be a distant memory, a common ancestor to beings as different from us as we are from the first life on Earth."
